                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I played this when I was first getting into pc games as a kid. when I found it on steam I was super excited and for a basic point and click it still holds up pretty well. I downloaded the rest of the games when I got this one as well. Part of the reason I wanted to write the review is to warn people that if they were going to continue with the rest of the series the second one can be downloaded from steam but there is a glitch in it that makes it unplayable. Some of the puzzle pieces do not spawn in correctly and make it to where early game tasks can't be completed and progression is impossible.",
